---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CopyBlock from '../components/CopyBlock.astro';
---

<Layout
  path="/platform"
  title="Run your own nest - Nuthatch"
  description="Nuthatch is one binary you run yourself. Install it, point it at a contract, and query a live indexed API on your own machine."
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <p class="section-label">Run your own nest</p>
      <h1>Nuthatch runs on your machine.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        There is no Nuthatch service to sign up for. It is one binary: install it, give it a
        contract address, and it indexes that contract's events into a local SQL database with an
        HTTP API and an MCP server.
      </p>
      <CopyBlock command="curl -fsSL https://nuthatch-indexer.com/install.sh | sh" size="lg" />
      <p>
        <a href="/install">Install options</a> covers prebuilt binaries, container images and
        building from source. <a href="/docs/start/quickstart/">The quickstart</a> goes from a
        contract address to a first query.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
